#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Middleware"
msgstr "Middleware"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Yii works with HTTP using the abstraction layer built around [PSR-7 HTTP message interfaces](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/)  and [PSR-15 request handler/middleware interfaces](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-15/)."
msgstr "O Yii trabalha com HTTP usando a camada de abstração construída em torno das [interfaces de mensagens HTTP da PSR-7](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/)  e das [interfaces de request handler/middleware da PSR-15](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-15/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "The application is composed of one or several middleware. Middleware runs between request and response.  When the URL is requested, the request object is passed to the middleware dispatcher that starts executing middleware one after another.  Each middleware, given the request, can:"
msgstr "A aplicação é composta por um ou vários middlewares. O middleware roda entre a requisição e a resposta.  Quando a URL é requisitada, o objeto de requisição é passado para o dispatcher de middlewares, que começa a executar os middlewares um após o outro.  Cada middleware, dada a requisição, pode:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Pass the request to the next middleware performing some work before / after it."
msgstr "Passar a requisição para o próximo middleware, fazendo algum trabalho antes / depois dele."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Form the response and return it."
msgstr "Montar a resposta e devolvê-la."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Depending on middleware used, application behavior may vary significantly."
msgstr "Dependendo dos middlewares usados, o comportamento da aplicação pode variar bastante."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "![Middleware](/images/guide/middleware.svg)"
msgstr "![Middleware](/images/guide/middleware.svg)"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "In the above each next middleware wraps the previous middleware. Alternatively, it could be presented as follows:"
msgstr "Acima, cada middleware seguinte envolve o anterior. Também é possível representar assim:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "![Middleware](/images/guide/middleware_alternative.svg)"
msgstr "![Middleware](/images/guide/middleware_alternative.svg)"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using middleware"
msgstr "Usando middlewares"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Any [PSR-15](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-15/) compatible middleware could be used with Yii, and there are many.  Say, you need to add basic authentication to one of the application URLs.  URL-dependent middleware is configured using router, so you need to change the router factory."
msgstr "Qualquer middleware compatível com a [PSR-15](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-15/) pode ser usado com o Yii, e existem muitos.  Digamos que você precise adicionar autenticação básica a uma das URLs da aplicação.  Middlewares que dependem da URL são configurados pelo router, então você precisa alterar a router factory."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Authentication middleware is implemented by `middlewares/http-authentication` package so execute `composer require middlewares/http-authentication` in the application root directory."
msgstr "O middleware de autenticação é implementado pelo pacote `middlewares/http-authentication`, então execute `composer require middlewares/http-authentication` na pasta raiz da aplicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Now register the middleware in DI container configuration `config/web.php`:"
msgstr "Agora registre o middleware na configuração do container de DI, `config/web.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\\Middlewares\\BasicAuthentication::class => [\n"
"    'class' => \\Middlewares\\BasicAuthentication::class,\n"
"    '__construct()' => [\n"
"        'users' => [\n"
"            'foo' => 'bar',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"    'realm()' => ['Access to the staging site via basic auth'],\n"
"    'attribute()' => ['username'],\n"
"],\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\\Middlewares\\BasicAuthentication::class => [\n"
"    'class' => \\Middlewares\\BasicAuthentication::class,\n"
"    '__construct()' => [\n"
"        'users' => [\n"
"            'foo' => 'bar',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"    'realm()' => ['Access to the staging site via basic auth'],\n"
"    'attribute()' => ['username'],\n"
"],\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "In the `config/routes.php`, add new route:"
msgstr "No `config/routes.php`, adicione uma nova rota:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Middlewares\\BasicAuthentication;\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    //...\n"
"    Route::get('/basic-auth')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'auth'])\n"
"        ->name('site/auth')\n"
"        ->prependMiddleware(BasicAuthentication::class)\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Middlewares\\BasicAuthentication;\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    //...\n"
"    Route::get('/basic-auth')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'auth'])\n"
"        ->name('site/auth')\n"
"        ->prependMiddleware(BasicAuthentication::class)\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "When configuring routing, you're binding `/basic-auth` URL to a chain of middleware consisting of basic authentication, and the action itself. A chain is a special middleware that executes all the middleware it's configured with."
msgstr "Ao configurar o roteamento, você está associando a URL `/basic-auth` a uma cadeia de middlewares formada pela autenticação básica e pela própria action. Uma cadeia é um middleware especial que executa todos os middlewares com que foi configurada."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "The action itself could be the following:"
msgstr "A action em si poderia ser a seguinte:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function auth(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    $response = $this->responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"    $response->getBody()->write('Hi ' . $request->getAttribute('username'));\n"
"    return $response;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function auth(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    $response = $this->responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"    $response->getBody()->write('Hi ' . $request->getAttribute('username'));\n"
"    return $response;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "Basic authentication middleware wrote to request `username` attribute, so you can access the data if needed."
msgstr "O middleware de autenticação básica gravou o atributo `username` na requisição, então você pode acessar esse dado se precisar."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "To apply middleware to application overall regardless of URL, adjust `config/application.php`:"
msgstr "Para aplicar um middleware à aplicação como um todo, independentemente da URL, ajuste o `config/application.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return [\n"
"    Yiisoft\\Yii\\Http\\Application::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'dispatcher' => DynamicReference::to(static function (Injector $injector) {\n"
"                return ($injector->make(MiddlewareDispatcher::class))\n"
"                    ->withMiddlewares(\n"
"                        [\n"
"                            ErrorCatcher::class,\n"
"                            BasicAuthentication::class,\n"
"                            SessionMiddleware::class,\n"
"                            CsrfTokenMiddleware::class,\n"
"                            Router::class,\n"
"                        ]\n"
"                    );\n"
"            }),\n"
"            'fallbackHandler' => Reference::to(NotFoundHandler::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"return [\n"
"    Yiisoft\\Yii\\Http\\Application::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'dispatcher' => DynamicReference::to(static function (Injector $injector) {\n"
"                return ($injector->make(MiddlewareDispatcher::class))\n"
"                    ->withMiddlewares(\n"
"                        [\n"
"                            ErrorCatcher::class,\n"
"                            BasicAuthentication::class,\n"
"                            SessionMiddleware::class,\n"
"                            CsrfTokenMiddleware::class,\n"
"                            Router::class,\n"
"                        ]\n"
"                    );\n"
"            }),\n"
"            'fallbackHandler' => Reference::to(NotFoundHandler::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating your own middleware"
msgstr "Criando o seu próprio middleware"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "To create middleware, you need to implement a single `process` method of `Psr\\Http\\Server\\MiddlewareInterface`:"
msgstr "Para criar um middleware, você precisa implementar um único método, `process`, da `Psr\\Http\\Server\\MiddlewareInterface`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface;\n"
msgstr "public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "There are multiple ways to handle a request, and choosing one depends on what the middleware should achieve."
msgstr "Há várias formas de tratar uma requisição, e a escolha depende do que o middleware deve fazer."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Forming a response directly"
msgstr "Montando uma resposta diretamente"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "To respond directly, one needs a response factory passed via constructor:"
msgstr "Para responder diretamente, é preciso uma response factory passada pelo construtor:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\MiddlewareInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\RequestHandlerInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class RespondingMiddleware implements MiddlewareInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory\n"
"    )\n"
"    {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $response = $this->responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"        $response->getBody()->write('Hello!');\n"
"        return $response;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\MiddlewareInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\RequestHandlerInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class RespondingMiddleware implements MiddlewareInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory\n"
"    )\n"
"    {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $response = $this->responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"        $response->getBody()->write('Hello!');\n"
"        return $response;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delegating handling to the next middleware"
msgstr "Delegando o tratamento para o próximo middleware"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If middleware either isn't intended to form a response or change the request or can't do anything this time,\n"
"handling could be left to the next middleware in the stack:  \n"
msgstr ""
"Se o middleware não tem a intenção de montar uma resposta nem de alterar a requisição, ou se não pode fazer nada desta vez,\n"
"o tratamento pode ficar para o próximo middleware da pilha:  \n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    return $handler->handle($request);    \n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    return $handler->handle($request);    \n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "In case you need to pass data to the next middleware, you can use request attributes:"
msgstr "Se você precisar passar dados para o próximo middleware, pode usar atributos da requisição:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$request = $request->withAttribute('answer', 42);\n"
"return $handler->handle($request);\n"
msgstr ""
"$request = $request->withAttribute('answer', 42);\n"
"return $handler->handle($request);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "To get it in the next middleware:"
msgstr "Para obtê-los no próximo middleware:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$answer = $request->getAttribute('answer');\n"
msgstr "$answer = $request->getAttribute('answer');\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capturing response to manipulate it"
msgstr "Capturando a resposta para manipulá-la"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
msgid "You may want to capture the response to manipulate it. It could be useful for adding CORS headers, gzipping content, etc."
msgstr "Você pode querer capturar a resposta para manipulá-la. Isso pode ser útil para adicionar headers CORS, compactar o conteúdo com gzip etc."

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/middleware.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$response = $handler->handle($request);\n"
"// extra handing\n"
"return $response;\n"
msgstr ""
"$response = $handler->handle($request);\n"
"// tratamento extra\n"
"return $response;\n"
